    [BugFix][Quantization] Release ModelSlim MoE reload metadata references (#17344)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    The ModelSlim MoE loader wrapper closes over a bound method, retaining
    its layer through vLLM reload metadata. Return a method bound to the
    owning layer so the existing reload sanitizer can break that reference;
    preserve the plain-callable path and weight-name mapping.
    
    Fixes https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/18679
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Discarded MoE layers and their weight tensors can be collected after
    reload metadata is recorded. Weight-name mapping, forwarded arguments
    and loader return values are unchanged.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
